id: pm-rust-legacy-hour24-separators
title: Match legacy separators in stored end-of-day timestamps
description: "The published 2026.11.18 SDK accepts a stored update timestamp of 2026-08-06,24:00:00Z and calculates eligibility from August 7 midnight. The native end-of-day parser recognizes T, t and space. Verify alternate delimiters against the pinned SDK before expanding stored timestamp parity."
